<body>
<h1>Minisforum N5 EC / IT5571 Driver</h1>
<div class="sub">
  内核模块 Kernel module: <b>minisforum_n5_it5571</b> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  hwmon: <span id="hwmon-id"><?= $loaded ? basename($data['hwmon']) : 'not loaded / 未加载' ?></span>
</div>

<? if (!$loaded): ?>
  <div class="warnbox">⚠ 内核模块未加载 The <b>minisforum_n5_it5571</b> kernel module is not loaded.
  请检查 Check <tt>dmesg | grep -i minisforum</tt> 与插件安装日志 and the plugin installation log.</div>
<? else: ?>

<div class="card">
<h2>风扇通道 Fan Channels</h2>
<table id="pwm-table">
<thead><tr>
  <th>通道 Channel</th><th>PWM</th><th>模式 Mode</th><th>转速 RPM</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
<? foreach ($data['pwm'] as $r): ?>
<tr data-ch="<?= $r['label']['en'] ?>">
  <td><?= htmlspecialchars($r['label']['zh']) ?> <span class="lang"><?= htmlspecialchars($r['label']['en']) ?></span></td>
  <td class="num pwm"><?= $r['pwm'] ?? '—' ?> / 255</td>
  <td class="mode"><?= $r['mode'] === 'manual' ? '<span class="badge manual">手动 / 被其他软件接管 Manual / Software takeover</span>' : ($r['mode'] === 'bios' ? '<span class="badge bios">EC/BIOS 自动 Auto</span>' : '—') ?></td>
  <td class="num fan"><?= $r['fan'] !== null ? $r['fan'].' RPM' : '—' ?></td>
</tr>
<? endforeach; ?>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="note">PCIe 风扇无转速反馈（该主板固件未开放）PCIe Fan has no RPM feedback on this board — zero is expected.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>温度 Temperatures</h2>
<table id="temp-table">
<thead><tr><th>传感器 Sensor</th><th>数值 Value</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<? foreach ($data['temp'] as $r): ?>
<tr data-temp="<?= $r['label']['en'] ?>">
  <td><?= htmlspecialchars($r['label']['zh']) ?> <span class="lang"><?= htmlspecialchars($r['label']['en']) ?></span></td>
  <td class="num temp"><span class="tval"><?= $r['c'] ?></span> °C
    <span class="badge <?= $r['c'] >= 80 ? 'warn' : 'ok' ?>"><?= $r['c'] >= 80 ? '过热 HOT' : '正常 OK' ?></span>
  </td>
</tr>
<? endforeach; ?>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>

<? endif; ?>

<div class="note">
  风扇控制建议使用 Fan control: <b>FanCtrl Plus 2</b>（推荐 recommended）
  系统温控建议使用 System temperature: <b>Dynamix System Temperature</b>
  每路 PWM 只交给一个控制器 Assign each PWM to one controller only。
  模块仅恢复本次实际修改的通道 The module restores only channels it modified.
</div>

